      "descs": [
        {
          "lang": "da",
          "subject": "Uddybning",
          "details": "<p><strong>Indtil ultimo januar 2026</strong>, udf&oslash;res uddybning i et omr&aring;de&nbsp; afgr&aelig;nset af en linje gennem position 1) - 4).</p>\n<table class=\"position-table\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">1)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 05,735'N - 014&deg; 40,932'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">2)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 05,725'N - 014&deg; 40,942'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">3)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 05,817'N - 014&deg; 41,226'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">4)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 05,827'N - 014&deg; 41,217'E</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Arbejdet udf&oslash;res fra fart&oslash;jet &raquo;JETTE SAJ&laquo; (<span>OUVS</span>),&nbsp;der kan kontaktes p&aring; VHF kanal 16.</p>\n<p>Skibsfarten anmodes om at vise hensyn ved passage.</p>"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "subject": "Dredging",
          "details": "<p><strong>Until ending January 2026</strong>,&nbsp;dredging&nbsp;is being carried out in the area bounded by a line through positions 1) - 4).</p>\n<table class=\"position-table\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">1)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 05.735'N - 014&deg; 40.932'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">2)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 05.725'N - 014&deg; 40.942'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">3)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 05.817'N - 014&deg; 41.226'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">4)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 05.827'N - 014&deg; 41.217'E</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The work&nbsp;is being carried out from the vessel&nbsp;<span>&raquo;JETTE SAJ&laquo; (OUVS)</span>,&nbsp;<span>which can be contacted on VHF channel 16.</span></p>\n<p><span>Mariners are requested to pass with caution.</span></p>"
        }
